.Dd $Mdocdate$
.Dt EGGHEAD-CONFIG 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm egghead-config
.Nd view and edit configuration
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm egghead config
.Nm egghead config
.Cm set Ar key Ar value
.Nm egghead config
.Cm path
.Nm egghead config
.Cm show-cookie
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Cm config
inspects and edits the configuration file at
.Pa ~/.config/egghead/config.yml
(respecting
.Ev XDG_CONFIG_HOME
and
.Ev EGGHEAD_CONFIG ) .
.Cm set
edits the YAML in place, preserving comments and whitespace where
it can. The full configuration schema is in
.Xr egghead 5 .
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "show-cookie"
.It Cm (default)
Print the current configuration.
.It Cm set Ar key Ar value
Set a value using dot-path notation: nested keys are addressed as
.Sy web.port ,
.Sy default_model ,
and so on.
.It Cm path
Print the resolved configuration file path.
.It Cm show-cookie
Print the BEAM distribution cookie at
.Pa ~/.erlang.cookie
to standard output, with explanatory commentary on standard error.
Used to bootstrap cross-host BEAM distribution: copy the cookie to
each peer host at the same path with mode
.Sy 0400 .
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width "--config path"
.It Fl -config Ar path
Override the configuration file location.
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Show help.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
egghead config
egghead config path
egghead config set web.port 8080
egghead config set default_model anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-6
egghead config show-cookie | ssh peer 'cat > ~/.erlang.cookie'
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr egghead-init 1 ,
.Xr egghead-doctor 1 ,
.Xr egghead 5 ,
.Xr egghead 1
